{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the logging railways of California's Sierra mountains! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This model railway map focuses on the winding trackwork surrounding Tuolumne in the 1950's during the era of Shay steam engines and constant expansion deeper into the pine forests of the Sierras. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a first for Rolling Line, this map features a full chain of loading and unloading:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Load logs on to skeleton cars in various alpine logging camps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unload logs into the log pond at the Tuolumne lumber mill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Load cut planks from the mill and deliver them to the lumber yard in Standard. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This map is completely free, and can be accessed from the &quot;New Game&quot; map list in-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685460/extras/map_storePage_small.png?t=1746853566\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3685460?t=1746853566","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685460/4150b95317a01e8403f69065c1d3af2cdac8a26a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746853566","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685460/ae2caef2760ed493c268afc7ae685aacb076ba5c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746853566","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685460/ae2caef2760ed493c268afc7ae685aacb076ba5c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746853566","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the logging railways of California's Sierra mountains! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This model railway map focuses on the winding trackwork surrounding Tuolumne in the 1950's during the era of Shay steam engines and constant expansion deeper into the pine forests of the Sierras. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a first for Rolling Line, this map features a full chain of loading and unloading:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Load logs on to skeleton cars in various alpine logging camps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unload logs into the log pond at the Tuolumne lumber mill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Load cut planks from the mill and deliver them to the lumber yard in Standard. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This map is completely free, and can be accessed from the &quot;New Game&quot; map list in-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685460/extras/map_storePage_small.png?t=1746853566\" /></p>","developers":["Gaugepunk Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"754150","name":"Rolling Line"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685460/da8aeae03ca848c2e9ce09418f92a0a2184ed1de/header.jpg?t=1746853566","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Rolling Line - Sierra Logging","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"ratings":